---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About | Delphi Daily" description="About Delphi Daily, an independent Delphi and Object Pascal blog.">
  <section class="article-header">
    <div class="reading-container">
      <p class="kicker">About</p>
      <h1>Independent notes for practical Delphi developers.</h1>
      <p class="article-description">
        Delphi Daily focuses on Object Pascal, VCL, FireDAC, SQL Server, Windows services,
        integration work, and the unglamorous code that quietly runs real companies.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <article class="reading-container article-content">
    <p>
      The goal is simple: publish clear, tested, production-minded Delphi content for developers
      who build and maintain real-world business applications.
    </p>

    <p>
      Delphi is a trademark of Embarcadero Technologies. Delphi Daily is an independent developer blog
      and is not affiliated with Embarcadero.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
